docs/planning/conversations-tracker.md
docs/planning/package-distribution-strategy.md
docs/planning/org-setup-reference.md
docs/reference/dead-lawyer-theory-reference.md
docs/reference/emoji-conventions-reference.md
*.swp
*.swo

# Uploads (never commit user documents)
backend/uploads/
backend/tmp/

